+++ b/.gitcode/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE_en.md
@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@
+# llvm-project repositoriy PR Information
+
+## Change Content**(Required)**
+
+Please describe the changes made in this Pull Request.
+
+## Change Type**(required)**
+
+Please describe the reason for this Pull Request, and **please fill in Y in the corresponding type's bracket**:
+
+- New feature ( )
+- Bugfix ( )
+- Changes in the build process or auxiliary tools ()
+- Document update ()
+
+## Self-inspection of change content
+
+### Screenshots proving the successful compilation of the compiler and standard library (required if involving new features, bugfix, or changes in the build process)
+
+Please provide screenshots of successful compilations for both the compiler and the standard library in your local environment.
+
+### Screenshots proving the self-verification of the test cases related to this Pull Request (required if involving new features or bugfix)
+
+Please provide screenshots of the self-verification of the test cases related to this Pull Request in your local environment.
+
+### Other information
+
+Any additional information related to this Pull Request can be added here.
\ No newline at end of file
